  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/rev/1009",
  "definition": "Aiding and Abetting an Understatement of Tax Liability",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-01",
  "historyNote": "#6662, eff 12-25-97; ss by #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1010.02) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
